    "Hard links are counted once within the scanned scope. APFS shared blocks, snapshots, and purgeable storage mean file sizes do not predict exactly how much free space cleanup will recover. Unknown metadata and inaccessible folders can make totals incomplete." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hard links are counted once within the scanned scope. APFS shared blocks, snapshots, and purgeable storage mean file sizes do not predict exactly how much free space cleanup will recover. Unknown metadata and inaccessible folders can make totals incomplete."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Жёсткие ссылки учитываются один раз в области сканирования. Общие блоки APFS, снимки и очищаемое хранилище не позволяют точно предсказать освобождаемое место. Неизвестные метаданные и недоступные папки делают итоги неполными."
          }
        }
      }
    },
